# Calibration JSON files for the OCR quality trust layer.
#
# One file per model id, named `{model_id}.json`. Each file holds a
# Platt-scaling pair `{"a": float, "b": float}` that maps raw VLM
# confidence to a calibrated value via `sigmoid(a * raw + b)`.
#
# Phase 1 ships this directory empty - Phase 3 trains and ships
# per-model files derived from OCR-Quality / KIE-HVQA datasets.